{
  "family": "ubnf",
  "section": "グローバル設定",
  "summary": "`@key: value` の形と値の集合。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "setting/package",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "### `@package`",
        "sentence": "生成コードの Java パッケージを指定します："
      },
      "input": "grammar G { @package: org.example.minilang R ::= 'x'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "accept"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "setting/colon-required",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## 形式的な文法定義",
        "sentence": "GlobalSetting::= '@' IDENTIFIER ':' SettingValue"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { @package org.example R ::= 'x'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "reject"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "setting/quoted-scalar-rejected",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## 形式的な文法定義",
        "sentence": "SettingValue ::= DottedIdentifier | '{' { IDENTIFIER ':' STRING } '}'"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { @package: 'org.example' R ::= 'x'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "reject"
      },
      "note": "SettingValue は DottedIdentifier かブロックのみ。"
    },
    {
      "id": "setting/block-value",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## 形式的な文法定義",
        "sentence": "SettingValue ::= DottedIdentifier | '{' { IDENTIFIER ':' STRING } '}'"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { @comment: { line: '//' } R ::= 'x'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "accept"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "setting/whitespace-javastyle",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "### `@whitespace`",
        "sentence": "`@whitespace: none` は自動空白処理を無効にします。rule の `@whitespace(...)` による 上書きや `@interleave` との優先順位は[両言語の trivia 契約](../../docs/rule-trivia.md)を参照。"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { @whitespace: javaStyle R ::= 'x'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "accept"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "setting/whitespace-none",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "### `@whitespace`",
        "sentence": "`@whitespace: none` は自動空白処理を無効にします。rule の `@whitespace(...)` による 上書きや `@interleave` との優先順位は[両言語の trivia 契約](../../docs/rule-trivia.md)を参照。"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { @whitespace: none R ::= 'x'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "accept"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "setting/whitespace-bad-style",
      "scope": "validate",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/validation.md",
        "heading": "### WHITESPACE エラー",
        "sentence": "| `E-WHITESPACE-GLOBAL-STYLE` | global style が `javaStyle` / `none` 以外、または block 設定 |"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { @whitespace: bogus R ::= 'x'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "diagnostic",
        "code": "E-WHITESPACE-GLOBAL-STYLE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "setting/whitespace-duplicate",
      "scope": "validate",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/validation.md",
        "heading": "### WHITESPACE エラー",
        "sentence": "| `E-WHITESPACE-GLOBAL-DUPLICATE` | global `@whitespace` が複数ある |"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { @whitespace: none @whitespace: javaStyle R ::= 'x'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "diagnostic",
        "code": "E-WHITESPACE-GLOBAL-DUPLICATE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "setting/whitespace-block-value",
      "scope": "validate",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/validation.md",
        "heading": "### WHITESPACE エラー",
        "sentence": "| `E-WHITESPACE-GLOBAL-STYLE` | global style が `javaStyle` / `none` 以外、または block 設定 |"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { @whitespace: { line: 'x' } R ::= 'x'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "diagnostic",
        "code": "E-WHITESPACE-GLOBAL-STYLE"
      },
      "note": "global style に block 設定を書くのはエラーと表に書かれている。"
    },
    {
      "id": "setting/unknown-key",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## 形式的な文法定義",
        "sentence": "GlobalSetting::= '@' IDENTIFIER ':' SettingValue"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { @nosuchsetting: a.b R ::= 'x'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "accept"
      },
      "note": "GlobalSetting は `'@' IDENTIFIER ':' SettingValue` で、キーの集合を制限していない。"
    }
  ]
}
